		(descr "WT32-ETH01 mounted FACE DOWN (components towards the board) on two 1x12 2.54 mm female sockets (pins 13 LINK and 14 GND left out: at the RJ45 end they fall outside the board edge, the module overhangs there), rows 22.86 mm apart. Mirror of WT32-ETH01_Socket: pin 1 (EN) is in the right-hand row seen from the top. Origin = module pin-field centre. Clone with WROOM-32 (measured): module PCB 26 x 58.33 mm (y -30.90..27.43), RJ45 15.9 x 21.14 mm (y 11.01..32.15, overhangs the module by 4.72). Verify row spacing with calipers.")
